      "created_at": "2017-11-10T15:52:25Z",
      "updated_at": "2017-11-10T15:52:25Z",
      "body": "Update: this is still an active issue, now in the desktop client. The wiki at https://github.com/WhisperSystems/Signal-Android/wiki/Submitting-useful-bug-reports#debug-log-privacy says \"However please note that the last two digits of your and your contacts phone numbers may be visible in the logs.\"\r\n\r\nTo find the debug log, go to `View > Debug Log`. The relevant lines in the debug log with three digits now look like:\r\n\r\n> INFO  [TIMESTAMP] PUT https://textsecure-service.whispersystems.org/v1/messages/+[REDACTED]123 200 Success",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
